{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-policy-defined-hours-backups-keep-1-month",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Snapshot Policy: Defined Hours Backups (Keep 1 Month)"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "This snapshot policy is configured for manual snapshot execution at defined times on Saturdays and Sundays only. Unlike recurring schedules, this setup uses the manual_incremental_backup field to specify the exact times when snapshots are taken."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Manual Backup Times: Snapshots are created at 02:00, 06:00, 20:00, and 22:15 UTC."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Active Days: Only on weekends (Saturday and Sunday)."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "introduction",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Retention Period: Snapshots are kept for 1 month before being automatically deleted."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "scheduler-configuration",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Scheduler Configuration"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "scheduler-configuration",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "The start_time and end_time fields restrict when snapshots are allowed to occur. Manual snapshots will only run within this defined window."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-retention-1-year-estimate",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Snapshot Retention (1-Year Estimate)"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-retention-1-year-estimate",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Snapshots occur 4 times per day, only on weekends."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-retention-1-year-estimate",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "2 weekend days per week = 8 snapshots per week."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-retention-1-year-estimate",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Over 1 month (approximately 4 weeks): → 4 snapshots × 2 days × 4 weeks = 32 snapshots retained at any time."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "snapshot-retention-1-year-estimate",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "After one year, the number of retained snapshots remains 32, as the retention policy only keeps the last month’s snapshots."
    },
